1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,861
This is Veriga.

2
00:00:01,901 --> 00:00:04,827
It turns the sales a small shop already

3
00:00:04,867 --> 00:00:07,730
makes into credit it can actually use.

4
00:00:08,512 --> 00:00:12,726
Picture a shop that's sold to the same families for years.

5
00:00:12,766 --> 00:00:16,401
It's all cash, so when the owner asks for a loan,

6
00:00:16,441 --> 00:00:18,721
nobody can see the business.

7
00:00:18,761 --> 00:00:23,040
Veriga fixes that, and her customers don't need any crypto.

8
00:00:23,867 --> 00:00:25,336
Here's Veriga.

9
00:00:25,376 --> 00:00:30,067
Everything you're about to see is live on QIE mainnet, today.

10
00:00:30,878 --> 00:00:35,572
For judges and first-time visitors, there's a three-minute tour.

11
00:00:35,612 --> 00:00:37,150
Let's follow it.

12
00:00:37,956 --> 00:00:40,503
Opening a shop takes one tap.

13
00:00:40,543 --> 00:00:42,321
No wallet, no gas.

14
00:00:42,361 --> 00:00:45,537
A key is created right in the browser,

15
00:00:45,577 --> 00:00:48,334
and Veriga pays the network fee.

16
00:00:48,374 --> 00:00:51,620
That was a real transaction on mainnet.

17
00:00:52,442 --> 00:00:55,738
Ada types the price the way she says it.

18
00:00:55,778 --> 00:00:58,518
Two thousand five hundred naira.

19
00:00:58,558 --> 00:01:01,714
Then she shows her customer a QR code.

20
00:01:02,580 --> 00:01:07,262
The customer scans it with any phone camera and taps yes.

21
00:01:07,302 --> 00:01:09,732
No app, no wallet, no fee.

22
00:01:09,772 --> 00:01:14,673
Two signatures from two phones, so nobody can fake it alone.

23
00:01:14,713 --> 00:01:17,215
And there's the green tick.

24
00:01:17,255 --> 00:01:18,668
It's on QIE.

25
00:01:19,679 --> 00:01:23,190
Her dashboard shows her sales, her trust score,

26
00:01:23,230 --> 00:01:27,387
and a short weekly note, worked out only from real sales.

27
00:01:27,427 --> 00:01:28,807
No AI guesses.

28
00:01:29,616 --> 00:01:32,521
It speaks her language too.

29
00:01:32,561 --> 00:01:36,560
Pidgin, Yoruba, Igbo, Hausa, or English.

30
00:01:37,357 --> 00:01:40,113
She can print a poster for her counter,

31
00:01:40,153 --> 00:01:43,029
so customers can pay or check her record.

32
00:01:43,821 --> 00:01:45,750
This is what a lender sees.

33
00:01:45,790 --> 00:01:48,449
Every receipt, the full score breakdown,

34
00:01:48,489 --> 00:01:51,598
and a check anyone can run in their own browser,

35
00:01:51,638 --> 00:01:55,253
to prove the score matches the fingerprint stored on QIE.

36
00:01:56,047 --> 00:01:57,624
Now the best part.

37
00:01:57,664 --> 00:02:00,050
This shop took a small advance,

38
00:02:00,090 --> 00:02:03,657
and its very next sale paid it back automatically,

39
00:02:03,697 --> 00:02:05,647
in the same transaction.

40
00:02:05,687 --> 00:02:07,575
Then its limit doubled.

41
00:02:08,359 --> 00:02:10,612
Cash sales build a reputation,

42
00:02:10,652 --> 00:02:13,027
but only money that really moved

43
00:02:13,067 --> 00:02:15,742
on-chain can raise a borrowing limit.

44
00:02:15,782 --> 00:02:18,338
And statements export in ISO 20022,

45
00:02:18,378 --> 00:02:20,631
the format banks already read.

46
00:02:21,425 --> 00:02:24,566
Customers who do have crypto can pay in QUSDC,

47
00:02:24,606 --> 00:02:28,335
or in QIE that swaps through QIEDEX in the same payment,

48
00:02:28,375 --> 00:02:30,985
checked against the QIE price oracle.

49
00:02:31,788 --> 00:02:34,499
So where does the money come from?

50
00:02:34,539 --> 00:02:38,626
Anyone can lend QUSDC to shops, earn the fees they pay,

51
00:02:38,666 --> 00:02:41,246
and take it back when they want.

52
00:02:41,286 --> 00:02:43,997
Only lenders can move their money.

53
00:02:44,037 --> 00:02:45,308
Not even us.

54
00:02:46,102 --> 00:02:49,916
And you don't have to take our word for any of it.

55
00:02:49,956 --> 00:02:53,238
Here's that repayment on the QIE explorer.

56
00:02:54,037 --> 00:02:55,243
Veriga.

57
00:02:55,283 --> 00:02:58,066
Every sale becomes credit.

58
00:02:58,106 --> 00:03:02,301
Try it yourself at veriga-sigma.vercel.app.
